        <p><strong>Correct!</strong> "Were" is the correct plural form of the verb "to be" that agrees with the plural subject "students".</p>
    </qti-modal-feedback>
    
    <qti-modal-feedback outcome-identifier="FEEDBACK" identifier="singular_error" show-hide="show">
